{"4102500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "In the Belly of the Night", "steam_appid": 4102500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/619944bbe604abccb3fb43e8a75f2cd0.poster.avif?t=1786347800\" width=798 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/619944bbe604abccb3fb43e8a75f2cd0.webm?t=1786347800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/619944bbe604abccb3fb43e8a75f2cd0.mp4?t=1786347800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear, memory, and motherhood intertwined in a story of loss and resilience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freya, travelling alone and pregnant through rural Türkiye, is drawn to an abandoned town lost to time. Searching for a way through, she moves through silence and ruin, unaware that an ancient Mesopotamian terror is waiting beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Belly of the Night is a story-driven survival horror that blends classic design with a modern heartbeat. Explore the ruins, uncover hidden paths, and solve puzzles that test both logic and nerve. <br><br>The deeper you go, the darker it will get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/3550a2ffb1ebb2cd85f47bdf1b1d44b6.poster.avif?t=1786347800\" width=798 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/3550a2ffb1ebb2cd85f47bdf1b1d44b6.webm?t=1786347800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/3550a2ffb1ebb2cd85f47bdf1b1d44b6.mp4?t=1786347800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed-camera survival horror inspired by 90s classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A feature-length horror experience to play through in one sitting, like a film.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management, exploration of secrets and limited but tense combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological and environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eerie and nostalgic original soundtrack and immersive sound design</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/619944bbe604abccb3fb43e8a75f2cd0.poster.avif?t=1786347800\" width=798 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/619944bbe604abccb3fb43e8a75f2cd0.webm?t=1786347800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/619944bbe604abccb3fb43e8a75f2cd0.mp4?t=1786347800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear, memory, and motherhood intertwined in a story of loss and resilience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freya, travelling alone and pregnant through rural Türkiye, is drawn to an abandoned town lost to time. Searching for a way through, she moves through silence and ruin, unaware that an ancient Mesopotamian terror is waiting beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Belly of the Night is a story-driven survival horror that blends classic design with a modern heartbeat. Explore the ruins, uncover hidden paths, and solve puzzles that test both logic and nerve. <br><br>The deeper you go, the darker it will get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/3550a2ffb1ebb2cd85f47bdf1b1d44b6.poster.avif?t=1786347800\" width=798 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/3550a2ffb1ebb2cd85f47bdf1b1d44b6.webm?t=1786347800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/3550a2ffb1ebb2cd85f47bdf1b1d44b6.mp4?t=1786347800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed-camera survival horror inspired by 90s classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A feature-length horror experience to play through in one sitting, like a film.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management, exploration of secrets and limited but tense combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological and environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eerie and nostalgic original soundtrack and immersive sound design</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Alone and pregnant in rural Türkiye, Freya explores a town lost to time and haunted by an ancient myth. Search, solve, and survive encounters with things better left buried, in a cinematic, fixed-camera survival horror about fear and resilience.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/fc7b77145023abe2d69cc0486ab2ca8f857351a2/header.jpg?t=1786347800", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/a94ea3ce2b7b0bf7f9703142f9